WEBVTT

01:32.126 --> 01:37.444
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.444 --> 01:40.503
[Episode 20]

01:42.286 --> 01:44.239
No wonder Huanyun Tower
does such great business.

01:45.159 --> 01:46.719
The beds here are so nice.

01:51.280 --> 01:52.599
Actually, tonight,

01:53.439 --> 01:55.040
I've always wanted to find an opportunity

01:56.120 --> 01:57.519
to have a real conversation with you.

01:58.400 --> 01:59.760
What do you want to know?

01:59.760 --> 02:01.079
I will tell you all that I know.

02:01.840 --> 02:03.680
That's great.

02:03.680 --> 02:05.239
You were so busy today,

02:05.239 --> 02:06.599
and I couldn't bear to disturb you.

02:07.599 --> 02:09.520
Fortunately, there's a lack of guest rooms

02:09.520 --> 02:10.520
so I could put on a thick face

02:10.520 --> 02:11.879
and squeeze into your room

02:11.879 --> 02:13.520
to ask you for some business advice.

02:16.800 --> 02:18.360
You are a shop owner yourself.

02:18.360 --> 02:20.560
Huamanzhu is booming like a marketplace.

02:20.560 --> 02:22.360
Why would you need advice?

02:22.360 --> 02:24.840
There's so much that I don't know.

02:24.840 --> 02:27.120
Now Huamanzhu is just one shop,

02:27.120 --> 02:28.479
and I can manage it with some effort.

02:29.000 --> 02:30.199
But in the future, I plan

02:30.199 --> 02:31.680
to open many branches

02:31.680 --> 02:33.039
and face more customers.

02:33.639 --> 02:35.879
Mudan, you have ambition and courage.

02:36.439 --> 02:37.719
Surely, you will achieve your wishes.

02:38.919 --> 02:40.400
Yunniang, please tell me quickly.

02:41.199 --> 02:43.159
Huanyun Tower sells beverages and food.

02:43.159 --> 02:44.639
It also offers guest rooms.

02:44.639 --> 02:46.120
There are even singing
and dancing performances.

02:47.120 --> 02:48.199
With so many activities

02:48.199 --> 02:49.719
mixed with business,

02:50.479 --> 02:51.879
how do you manage it all?

02:52.479 --> 02:54.240
If you want to expand your business,

02:54.240 --> 02:55.560
you can't rely solely on yourself.

02:56.479 --> 02:58.840
You need to depend on
talented people around you.

02:59.599 --> 03:01.520
As the saying goes, a ruler has its short end

03:01.520 --> 03:02.639
as an inch has its long side.

03:03.240 --> 03:04.719
You have to put each of them

03:04.719 --> 03:06.960
in their best-suited position,

03:06.960 --> 03:08.120
letting your helpers

03:08.120 --> 03:09.680
play to their strengths.

03:20.479 --> 03:21.736
Your Highness.

03:22.360 --> 03:24.039
I am deeply flattered

03:24.039 --> 03:25.479
[With virtue comes capacity]
by the County Princess' affection.

03:26.159 --> 03:27.439
But it is not what is desired.

03:28.280 --> 03:29.840
If the marriage is forced,

03:29.840 --> 03:31.120
it will only be unfair to the County Princess.

03:35.800 --> 03:37.400
I sincerely ask Your Highness

03:37.400 --> 03:39.319
to annul the marriage contract
between the County Princess and me.

03:41.360 --> 03:42.840
Did you argue with Youzhen?

03:44.599 --> 03:46.280
She has been pampered since childhood,

03:46.280 --> 03:48.360
so she can be a bit willful.

03:49.080 --> 03:50.599
Just indulge her more.

03:51.360 --> 03:52.599
I have given it thorough consideration.

03:53.120 --> 03:54.759
It's not a decision made
in the heat of the moment.

03:55.280 --> 03:57.360
I sincerely ask for your approval.

04:10.000 --> 04:11.680
Youzhen has deep feelings for you.

04:12.520 --> 04:13.719
For the sake of your official position,

04:13.719 --> 04:15.080
she has pleaded with me several times.

04:15.599 --> 04:17.480
Now you suddenly want to call off the marriage.

04:18.360 --> 04:20.079
For one, it disrespects her affection,

04:21.199 --> 04:22.759
and for two, where does that leave

04:22.759 --> 04:24.000
the royal family's face?

04:25.920 --> 04:26.959
Calling off the marriage

04:27.800 --> 04:28.879
is my going back on my word.

04:29.759 --> 04:32.240
I am willing to resign from my position as the
Additional Secretary of the Ministry of Revenue.

04:32.240 --> 04:33.240
However the king decides to deal with me,

04:33.800 --> 04:34.839
I will have no complaints.

04:39.920 --> 04:41.160
Have you thought this through?

04:42.680 --> 04:43.784
Yes.

04:46.040 --> 04:47.336
Okay.

04:53.360 --> 04:54.399
As a father,

04:55.319 --> 04:56.759
Youzhen's happiness

04:56.759 --> 04:58.920
has always been of great concern to me.

05:00.040 --> 05:02.079
I was once worried
that you were only marrying her

05:02.079 --> 05:03.319
for the sake of your career.

05:05.040 --> 05:07.000
However, your words just now

05:07.720 --> 05:09.079
were indeed the words of a gentleman.

05:09.959 --> 05:12.079
It made me see you in a new light.

05:14.720 --> 05:16.040
Come on.

05:23.800 --> 05:25.079
You are a talent that can be shaped.

05:26.079 --> 05:27.920
With a bit of experience,

05:27.920 --> 05:29.240
you will certainly achieve greatness.

05:30.600 --> 05:33.720
Here, I will transfer you elsewhere first.

05:33.720 --> 05:35.439
As for whether you can rise again,

05:36.279 --> 05:38.319
that will depend on your own abilities.

05:41.480 --> 05:42.600
Thank you, Your Highness.

05:42.600 --> 05:44.399
I am endlessly grateful.

06:04.199 --> 06:05.879
Master, Master.

06:05.879 --> 06:08.279
Prince Ning has already consented
to the annulment of the betrothal.

06:08.279 --> 06:09.920
Father, there is no need
to waste any more words.

06:10.600 --> 06:12.800
- I will beat you to death today!
- Master.

06:12.800 --> 06:13.839
It was my fault.

06:14.839 --> 06:16.480
However Father chooses to punish me,

06:16.480 --> 06:17.720
I am willing to accept it.

06:19.160 --> 06:21.399
But there is one thing
I must remind you, Father.

06:21.399 --> 06:23.079
Today, Minister Chen has entered the capital.

06:23.079 --> 06:24.319
With Father's talents,

06:24.839 --> 06:26.079
you can persuade him

06:26.079 --> 06:27.120
to preserve your position,

06:27.759 --> 06:28.759
free of my effect.

06:36.279 --> 06:37.959
Get up, get up!

06:53.000 --> 06:54.800
It's just a little quarrel

06:54.800 --> 06:56.319
among children.

06:57.879 --> 06:59.319
Liu Shen said

06:59.319 --> 07:00.439
that he would certainly

07:00.439 --> 07:02.199
persuade Liu Chang

07:02.199 --> 07:04.959
to reconcile with the County Princess.

07:08.120 --> 07:09.439
Liu Shen

07:09.439 --> 07:11.639
is too ashamed to see you

07:11.639 --> 07:14.079
so he asked me to deliver

07:14.079 --> 07:15.528
his month's tribute for him.

07:23.240 --> 07:25.240
There are nine more boxes outside

07:26.600 --> 07:27.959
Ever since Liu Shen

07:27.959 --> 07:29.680
became the Minister of the Imperial Treasury,

07:29.680 --> 07:31.680
his money and silk presented to you

07:32.240 --> 07:33.959
have doubled.

07:33.959 --> 07:35.319
Although Liu Shen

07:36.279 --> 07:37.600
is timid and afraid,

07:38.360 --> 07:40.519
He is a good money-maker

07:42.680 --> 07:44.480
The grand cause

07:44.480 --> 07:47.360
requires money and silk for facilitation.

07:47.360 --> 07:48.639
We might as well

07:48.639 --> 07:50.319
keep the Liu family

07:50.319 --> 07:52.040
for financial purposes.

08:00.600 --> 08:01.960
Fine.

08:02.959 --> 08:04.680
Since you're willing to speak for him,

08:05.319 --> 08:06.360
it seems he still has

08:06.879 --> 08:08.839
some ability to win people's hearts.

08:10.680 --> 08:12.000
You're wise, Your Highness.

08:12.000 --> 08:13.000
Rest assured.

08:13.000 --> 08:15.399
The dealings among the dukes and ministers

08:15.399 --> 08:16.759
won't involve him,

08:17.759 --> 08:20.720
but sometimes, the little
devils are troublesome.

08:20.720 --> 08:22.839
Those minor officials below

08:22.839 --> 08:25.040
are just right for the Liu family

08:25.040 --> 08:26.279
to step in and mingle.

08:37.080 --> 08:38.879
If you send that young master of the Liu family

08:38.879 --> 08:41.279
to serve as an official in such a place,

08:41.279 --> 08:42.639
he won't be able to bear it.

08:43.519 --> 08:44.879
Within a few days,

08:44.879 --> 08:46.600
he will surely come back and beg for mercy.

08:46.600 --> 08:47.600
Then,

08:47.600 --> 08:48.879
he will please the County Princess.

08:50.960 --> 08:52.440
He dared to insult my daughter,

08:53.559 --> 08:55.360
even if he turns back in the future,

08:56.120 --> 08:57.200
in these days,

08:57.720 --> 08:59.639
he must learn his lesson.

09:03.320 --> 09:05.320
Sheyan is so lucky.

09:05.960 --> 09:07.480
Every time, you personally

09:07.480 --> 09:09.279
go to the Imperial Stables Bureau
to choose a horse for him.

09:10.480 --> 09:12.279
Sheyan risks his life on my behalf,

09:12.279 --> 09:13.960
running around day and night.

09:13.960 --> 09:15.559
Naturally, he needs a few good horses.

09:16.600 --> 09:17.960
You are always by my side.

09:17.960 --> 09:20.159
You never make more than a few trips a year.

09:20.159 --> 09:21.559
What is there to be jealous about?

09:22.240 --> 09:23.559
That's not right, My lord.

09:23.559 --> 09:25.279
I have not spared any efforts for you either.

09:25.279 --> 09:27.080
You see, I have to occasionally repel

09:27.080 --> 09:28.559
attackers that emerge,

09:28.559 --> 09:31.080
and I have to put on an act
with you throughout the year.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.879
Alright.

09:32.879 --> 09:34.200
I know your labors are meritorious.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.759
That gold-inlaid knife in the armory

09:36.759 --> 09:38.639
is yours to play with.

09:38.639 --> 09:41.080
Really? Thank you, my lord!

09:41.080 --> 09:42.960
I would lay down my life for you, my lord.

09:47.927 --> 09:52.185
[Imperial Stable Bureau]

09:55.519 --> 09:57.240
Mr. Liu.

09:57.240 --> 09:58.679
Come on.

09:58.679 --> 10:00.759
Taste this delicious delicacy.

10:00.759 --> 10:01.759
Prefect Ge.

10:01.759 --> 10:03.320
That's a water scoop for washing horses.

10:03.320 --> 10:05.000
How can it be used for drinking water?

10:05.000 --> 10:06.120
Why not?

10:07.080 --> 10:09.799
Didn't you say it has been washed clean?

10:09.799 --> 10:12.399
Did you neglect your duties?

10:12.399 --> 10:14.159
Why try to frame someone?

10:14.159 --> 10:15.639
Why do you have to make
things difficult for me?

10:15.639 --> 10:17.096
Why?

10:17.720 --> 10:18.879
Mr. Liu.

10:18.879 --> 10:20.279
You are no longer

10:20.279 --> 10:21.960
the esteemed son-in-law of Prince Ning.

10:21.960 --> 10:23.879
You don't need to use
a jade cup to drink water.

10:24.639 --> 10:26.000
This shabby thing

10:26.759 --> 10:28.080
matches your status.

10:28.960 --> 10:30.320
Pry open his mouth now.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.039
Taste it.

10:34.039 --> 10:35.600
It's very tasty, isn't it?

10:39.000 --> 10:40.200
If you haven't had enough,

10:40.200 --> 10:41.960
how about another ladleful?

10:43.080 --> 10:44.200
Prefect Ge is better

10:44.200 --> 10:45.679
at taming people than horses, isn't he?

10:48.600 --> 10:49.639
Mr. Jiang.

10:49.639 --> 10:50.639
What are you doing here?

10:53.039 --> 10:54.600
The newcomer doesn't respect the rules.

10:55.279 --> 10:56.879
It's embarrassing, Floral Envoy.

10:57.639 --> 10:58.960
Are you here to choose a horse?

10:58.960 --> 11:00.200
I will personally take you to choose one.

11:00.200 --> 11:01.416
No need.

11:02.320 --> 11:04.639
Zishu and I are old acquaintances.

11:04.639 --> 11:05.799
Today,

11:05.799 --> 11:06.879
just let him accompany me.

11:17.720 --> 11:19.960
I'm impressed, Zishu.

11:20.879 --> 11:21.919
You dared to turn down

11:21.919 --> 11:22.919
the marriage proposal from Prince Ning.

11:25.600 --> 11:26.960
Prince Ning had also tried to set you up

11:26.960 --> 11:28.320
with the County Princess.

11:28.320 --> 11:30.120
Didn't you refuse it as well, Mr. Jiang?

11:31.600 --> 11:34.000
But the County Princess is
infatuated with only you.

11:34.559 --> 11:35.759
In my opinion,

11:35.759 --> 11:38.039
she has made up her mind to marry you.

11:38.039 --> 11:39.480
With such unwavering determination,

11:40.039 --> 11:41.919
you could clearly be
persuaded to go along with it.

11:41.919 --> 11:44.720
Why insist on making things
difficult for yourself?

11:46.759 --> 11:49.120
Mr. Jiang, are you here to speak
on behalf of Prince Ning?

11:50.159 --> 11:52.200
Or is it for the sake
of your neighbor next door

11:52.200 --> 11:53.360
that you offer such advice?

11:55.200 --> 11:57.440
It seems you are quite concerned

11:57.440 --> 11:58.519
about the floriculturist in Jiang Mansion.

12:01.320 --> 12:02.679
She faked her death,

12:02.679 --> 12:04.080
regained a decent household register,

12:04.919 --> 12:06.679
and opened Huamanzhu in Chang'an.

12:07.240 --> 12:08.240
I'm sure she had help

12:08.240 --> 12:09.679
from Mr. Jiang, right?

12:10.240 --> 12:12.240
I simply provided some capital

12:12.240 --> 12:13.679
and lied back to collect the interest.

12:14.559 --> 12:16.000
Her success today

12:16.000 --> 12:17.120
is all thanks to her own efforts.

12:18.639 --> 12:20.120
Back then in Luoyang,

12:20.120 --> 12:21.919
why did you help her get a divorce,

12:21.919 --> 12:23.208
Mr. Jiang?

12:24.360 --> 12:26.440
She was seriously bullied by the Liu family.

12:27.080 --> 12:29.000
As her husband, you did nothing,

12:29.000 --> 12:31.080
and yet you wouldn't allow others
to carry out acts of chivalry.

12:33.288 --> 12:35.159
Indeed, I have let her down in the past.

12:38.279 --> 12:40.879
But I will not be trapped
in this small stable forever.

12:41.799 --> 12:43.320
Once I rise to prominence,

12:43.320 --> 12:44.919
I will seek to marry her myself

12:45.440 --> 12:46.600
with heartfelt aspiration.

12:50.559 --> 12:52.000
Your thoughts are rather idealistic.

12:52.799 --> 12:53.879
But have you asked

12:53.879 --> 12:55.360
what He Weifang thinks?

12:57.000 --> 12:58.399
If my heart is sincere,

12:58.399 --> 12:59.679
it will surely move her.

13:02.080 --> 13:03.559
Although, Mr. Jiang,

13:03.559 --> 13:05.679
why are you so concerned about her future?

13:07.840 --> 13:10.320
Are you afraid she won't continue
to grow flowers and make money for you,

13:11.200 --> 13:12.960
or have you developed other private feelings?

13:18.480 --> 13:20.519
Whatever private thoughts I have are fine,

13:21.639 --> 13:23.879
but if the County Princess becomes
aware of your private thoughts,

13:24.440 --> 13:27.879
I fear she might once again
be in danger for her life.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.320
That's all there is to say.

13:33.480 --> 13:35.039
Take care.

13:41.200 --> 13:42.200
Thank you for before,

13:43.679 --> 13:44.679
Mr. Jiang.

13:55.039 --> 13:56.600
My Lord.

13:56.600 --> 13:58.720
Why do you meddle
in other people's family affairs?

13:58.720 --> 14:00.279
You're making trouble for yourself.

14:00.279 --> 14:02.000
What do you mean by 'family affairs'?

14:02.000 --> 14:03.399
They have long ceased to be a family.

14:03.960 --> 14:05.600
Jiang Xiaohua is now my moneybag.

14:06.559 --> 14:08.480
You have gold and silver
mountains in the treasury.

14:08.480 --> 14:10.799
Do you really need
a moneybag that's full of holes?

14:21.279 --> 14:23.039
Absolutely beautiful.

14:23.039 --> 14:25.639
We've already bought the deed
to the Huamanzhu property.

14:25.639 --> 14:27.879
Now you're no longer the Qin Wuniang

14:27.879 --> 14:29.000
at Wang Qing's mercy,

14:29.000 --> 14:31.360
but the Shopkeeper Qin
with your own storefront in Chang'an.

14:31.919 --> 14:33.080
On this journey home,

14:33.080 --> 14:34.120
you must stand tall.

14:36.039 --> 14:38.480
But in past years when I returned home,

14:38.480 --> 14:39.840
it was never so grand.

14:40.399 --> 14:42.039
Won't it be too ostentatious?

14:42.039 --> 14:43.879
Only by returning home in glory
can you make your family

14:43.879 --> 14:44.879
see you in a new light

14:44.879 --> 14:45.879
and let them know

14:45.879 --> 14:47.440
that your life has changed greatly.

14:48.279 --> 14:49.279
Now you are the most

14:49.279 --> 14:50.480
promising daughter in your family

14:50.480 --> 14:52.440
with broad prospects ahead.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.600
They will surely not look down on you anymore.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.480
Come on.

14:56.480 --> 14:57.480
Take this.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.639
- Okay.
- Go on with courage.

15:30.480 --> 15:31.559
Father, Mother.

15:31.559 --> 15:33.279
I'm back, sister-in-law.

15:33.279 --> 15:34.320
- Wuniang.
- Quan'er.

15:34.320 --> 15:35.559
- Wuniang.
- Auntie is back.

15:35.559 --> 15:36.904
Close the door.

15:40.960 --> 15:42.799
Come in quickly. Don't let others see.

15:47.320 --> 15:49.039
- Come over, give it to me.
- You have been abandoned.

15:49.039 --> 15:50.279
Don't be so flaunting.

15:50.279 --> 15:51.840
You don't know shame.

15:52.879 --> 15:54.399
If the neighbors see,

15:55.120 --> 15:56.399
I don't know what they'll say

15:56.399 --> 15:57.919
behind my back.

15:59.039 --> 16:01.279
I was almost beaten to death by Wang Qing.

16:01.279 --> 16:02.879
That's why I divorced him.

16:02.879 --> 16:03.960
I wasn't abandoned.

16:04.799 --> 16:06.480
There's nothing to be ashamed of.

16:06.480 --> 16:07.919
Anyway,

16:07.919 --> 16:09.879
you were driven out of your husband's home.

16:10.720 --> 16:11.720
I am so

16:11.720 --> 16:13.279
disgraced by you.

16:14.879 --> 16:16.799
Wang Qing seems quite decent.

16:16.799 --> 16:18.200
Wuniang must have been disrespectful

16:18.200 --> 16:19.399
and annoyed him.

16:19.399 --> 16:20.600
Come, let me have a look.

16:20.600 --> 16:22.320
- Son.
- Mother.

16:22.320 --> 16:23.639
Let's see what you have brought.

16:23.639 --> 16:26.000
Which couple doesn't quarrel?

16:26.799 --> 16:28.120
A woman should be gentle,

16:28.120 --> 16:29.440
and the home will be harmonious and peaceful.

16:30.639 --> 16:32.360
Your sister-in-law is right.

16:32.360 --> 16:33.600
You can't be

16:33.600 --> 16:35.000
so delicate as a wife.

16:35.559 --> 16:36.919
Only when your husband is pleased,

16:36.919 --> 16:38.440
can you live well.

16:40.399 --> 16:41.672
Come on.

16:42.279 --> 16:43.480
Son.

16:43.480 --> 16:44.519
Mother, don't move.

16:52.879 --> 16:54.440
What time is it? Why haven't
you started cooking yet?

17:01.480 --> 17:02.559
What are you standing around for?

17:02.559 --> 17:03.720
Go do some work!

17:06.119 --> 17:07.119
Look at how lazy you are.

17:07.119 --> 17:08.279
No wonder Wang Qing beats you.

17:08.279 --> 17:10.480
Go, go, go. Go wash the clothes.

17:20.839 --> 17:22.039
Let's see what else there is.

17:25.440 --> 17:26.536
Wuniang.

17:30.200 --> 17:31.319
Wuniang.

17:31.319 --> 17:32.720
You have finally returned.

17:32.720 --> 17:33.839
I missed you so much.

17:36.759 --> 17:38.120
Liulang.

17:39.039 --> 17:40.240
Me too.

17:42.160 --> 17:43.359
Wuniang.

17:43.359 --> 17:46.880
In the past, when flowers bloomed, you
always made osmanthus cakes for me.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.960
Today, you can taste my cooking.

17:59.680 --> 18:00.839
It's really delicious.

18:03.039 --> 18:04.392
Liulang.

18:05.240 --> 18:06.759
You've really grown up.

18:11.880 --> 18:14.240
Wuniang, you should have
left Wang Qing long ago.

18:15.200 --> 18:17.359
You must be living comfortably now.

18:17.359 --> 18:18.536
You've become even more beautiful.

18:27.359 --> 18:28.440
This osmanthus tree

18:29.079 --> 18:31.119
is the only bit of color in our home.

18:31.119 --> 18:32.519
Why chop it down?

18:33.599 --> 18:36.039
Our brother wants to make
a wooden horse for his son.

18:37.000 --> 18:39.119
Why did you bring back so many useless things?

18:39.759 --> 18:40.759
If you have spare money,

18:40.759 --> 18:42.240
buy your nephew some more clothes

18:42.240 --> 18:44.319
or a silver lock.

18:44.319 --> 18:46.440
Wuniang sent back money regularly.

18:46.440 --> 18:49.079
Every piece of clothing Father and Mother
wear was bought by her.

18:49.079 --> 18:50.799
What did you do for them?

18:51.519 --> 18:54.079
I gave birth to her, and I raised her.

18:54.680 --> 18:56.160
Isn't she supposed to do these things?

18:56.960 --> 18:59.200
If I didn't marry her off to Wang Qing,

18:59.200 --> 19:00.480
how could she go to Chang'an

19:00.480 --> 19:01.839
and live these good days now?

19:04.480 --> 19:07.240
I started living good days only
after I left Wang Qing.

19:09.279 --> 19:11.119
I opened a shop with two sisters

19:11.119 --> 19:13.480
and these come from our flower shop.

19:13.480 --> 19:15.240
They are in high demand
and short supply in Chang'an.

19:15.240 --> 19:17.839
In the coming days, we plan
to open a branch store.

19:17.839 --> 19:19.400
Sisters? What sisters?

19:20.039 --> 19:21.400
Open your eyes and look.

19:21.400 --> 19:23.480
These people in front of you
are your real family.

19:25.039 --> 19:26.680
Family?

19:26.680 --> 19:28.000
What have you done for me?

19:28.519 --> 19:30.559
Have you ever cared about me?

19:30.559 --> 19:31.720
Stupid girl.

19:32.559 --> 19:34.039
Father, what are you doing?

19:34.680 --> 19:36.839
A woman regards her husband as her heaven.

19:36.839 --> 19:38.680
Now your heaven has come crashing down,

19:38.680 --> 19:40.599
and yet you're here, smug and self-satisfied.

19:40.599 --> 19:42.640
Wuniang. Wuniang.

19:42.640 --> 19:44.519
You can't recognize a single character,

19:44.519 --> 19:45.799
and you want to do business.

19:45.799 --> 19:47.400
Are you cut out for it?

19:48.160 --> 19:50.200
You had a livelihood

19:50.200 --> 19:51.480
by relying on Wang Qing.

19:52.119 --> 19:53.680
You met some slick people,

19:53.680 --> 19:54.839
made some money,

19:54.839 --> 19:56.079
and you've become cocky.

19:56.640 --> 19:58.480
You're just doing odd jobs for others.

19:58.480 --> 20:00.880
Without others, what skills do you have?

20:00.880 --> 20:02.024
Alright.

20:03.319 --> 20:04.599
You show your face all day long,

20:04.599 --> 20:05.640
not abiding by women's morals.

20:05.640 --> 20:07.559
Which respectable family would want her?

20:08.559 --> 20:09.960
- Think carefully about it!
- Alright, alright.

20:09.960 --> 20:11.519
Wake up now! You step aside.

20:13.400 --> 20:14.880
Wuniang.

20:14.880 --> 20:17.079
How can you defy your father?

20:17.640 --> 20:19.559
Did some indecent person outside

20:19.559 --> 20:21.039
lead you astray?

20:22.079 --> 20:24.000
A woman must eventually marry.

20:24.000 --> 20:25.359
No matter how much money you make,

20:25.359 --> 20:27.559
it's meaningless without sons and daughters.

20:27.559 --> 20:29.319
You might as well go find Wang Qing

20:29.319 --> 20:30.599
and offer him an apology

20:30.599 --> 20:32.400
so that you can go home and live a good life.

20:34.200 --> 20:36.440
I never said I wouldn't marry.

20:37.400 --> 20:38.920
But Wang Qing

20:38.920 --> 20:40.920
is not a good man.

20:42.000 --> 20:43.519
Wang Qing won't take you back.

20:43.519 --> 20:45.000
You wish.

20:45.839 --> 20:46.984
Go and cook now.

20:48.640 --> 20:49.920
Wuniang.

20:49.920 --> 20:51.839
We all want the best for you.

20:53.039 --> 20:55.200
It doesn't matter if Wang Qing
doesn't want you anymore.

20:56.240 --> 20:57.400
Your father

20:57.400 --> 20:58.839
has already

20:58.839 --> 21:00.880
arranged a new husband for you.

21:01.759 --> 21:03.880
Let's meet him later.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.559
Who is it?

21:10.079 --> 21:11.160
At the east end of the village,

21:11.160 --> 21:12.456
the Zhou family.

21:13.039 --> 21:16.039
They only have one eldest son,

21:16.039 --> 21:17.480
who is over 40 years old

21:18.240 --> 21:20.200
and already has two children.

21:20.759 --> 21:22.400
You are a cast-off wife

21:22.400 --> 21:23.640
who has had a miscarriage.

21:24.240 --> 21:26.440
Whether you can still bear children
is yet another issue.

21:26.440 --> 21:27.440
Apart from a widower,

21:27.440 --> 21:28.759
who would want you?

21:29.400 --> 21:31.079
The Zhou family has land.

21:31.079 --> 21:32.480
If you take good care of it,

21:32.480 --> 21:33.720
it will be more stable

21:33.720 --> 21:35.079
than your life in Chang'an.

21:57.000 --> 21:59.640
Okay, this is the last time
I'm applying the medicine.

21:59.640 --> 22:01.640
From now on, whether you touch
water or work the soil,

22:01.640 --> 22:02.640
it will be fine.

22:04.240 --> 22:06.359
This scar is so smooth.

22:06.359 --> 22:07.680
It surely won't leave a mark.

22:08.279 --> 22:10.240
Chun's medical skills are miraculous.

22:10.240 --> 22:11.680
Truly impressive.

22:11.680 --> 22:12.680
Alright, Mudan,

22:12.680 --> 22:14.279
stop flattering me.

22:14.279 --> 22:15.480
It's the efficacy of the medicine.

22:15.480 --> 22:17.599
Whoever administers it, it's the same.

22:20.359 --> 22:21.519
No wonder when I sent

22:21.519 --> 22:23.400
the sick workers to find you,

22:23.400 --> 22:25.559
none of them seemed happy to get well.

22:25.559 --> 22:26.759
Your mouth

22:26.759 --> 22:28.319
is really hard for people to deal with.

22:29.599 --> 22:31.319
I only speak the truth.

22:31.319 --> 22:32.480
Why wouldn't they be happy?

22:33.759 --> 22:35.920
It's okay that you don't understand

22:35.920 --> 22:37.400
the flexible skills in dealing with people.

22:37.400 --> 22:38.519
You'll learn in time.

22:39.799 --> 22:41.000
Chun.

22:41.000 --> 22:42.440
If this ointment

22:42.440 --> 22:44.480
can remove scars and lighten spots,

22:44.480 --> 22:46.559
it must be needed by many women.

22:46.559 --> 22:48.559
Previously, we incorporated madder
root into the fragrance,

22:48.559 --> 22:50.000
and it was quite popular.

22:50.000 --> 22:51.279
Why don't we

22:51.279 --> 22:52.559
integrate medicine into makeup?

22:52.559 --> 22:54.359
How about we create
some nourishing facial balms

22:54.359 --> 22:55.920
and sell them at Huamanzhu?

22:56.960 --> 22:58.000
In that case,

22:58.000 --> 22:59.680
wouldn't it be able to help more people?

22:59.680 --> 23:01.400
Yes, I have thought about it.

23:01.400 --> 23:02.960
If the balm sells well,

23:02.960 --> 23:04.880
I will set up a separate shop for you

23:04.880 --> 23:06.000
and let you be the owner.

23:07.680 --> 23:09.359
I just want to refine my medical skills,

23:09.359 --> 23:10.400
heal the sick, and save lives.

23:10.920 --> 23:13.039
Looking after a shop to make money

23:13.799 --> 23:15.839
is something I neither want to do nor can do.

23:16.519 --> 23:17.640
Think about it.

23:17.640 --> 23:19.640
If you have your own store,

23:19.640 --> 23:21.359
it will be your small world

23:21.359 --> 23:23.480
where you can practice medicine
more freely and safely.

23:23.480 --> 23:25.680
It's good for both you and the patients.

23:26.240 --> 23:27.880
As for how to manage it,

23:27.880 --> 23:29.279
I can help you in the future.

23:29.279 --> 23:30.920
Or you can hire someone to take care of it.

23:32.279 --> 23:33.799
If I could practice medicine at ease,

23:33.799 --> 23:35.160
I might as well give it a try.

23:35.759 --> 23:36.799
However,

23:36.799 --> 23:38.720
can I really do it?

23:38.720 --> 23:39.880
Rest assured.

23:39.880 --> 23:42.039
My judgment of people has never been wrong.

23:42.039 --> 23:44.119
Once the shop opens,

23:44.119 --> 23:45.319
there will definitely be many people

23:45.319 --> 23:47.319
who come specifically for you.

23:47.319 --> 23:50.759
By then, Huamanzhu can also
proudly bask in the glory.

23:50.759 --> 23:53.279
Yes, proudly bask in the glory.

23:55.000 --> 23:56.799
You can't recognize a single character,

23:56.799 --> 23:58.079
and you want to do business.

23:58.079 --> 23:59.680
Are you cut out for it?

24:00.319 --> 24:02.240
You are just doing odd jobs for others.

24:02.759 --> 24:05.720
Without others, what skills do you have?

24:08.920 --> 24:12.599
Yes, what skills do I have?

24:14.720 --> 24:16.079
You're just taking me along

24:17.000 --> 24:18.279
out of kindness.

24:19.279 --> 24:21.240
Others can also be so close to you.

24:22.720 --> 24:24.839
When have I ever made you proud?

24:26.160 --> 24:28.839
Chun, you will make

24:29.519 --> 24:30.519
a good shopkeeper.

24:32.920 --> 24:34.240
You've been sitting here for so long

24:34.240 --> 24:35.799
hemming and hawing.

24:35.799 --> 24:37.519
You seem like you have something to say.

24:37.519 --> 24:38.920
What is it? Just say it.

24:39.680 --> 24:41.079
No, nothing.

24:41.759 --> 24:42.952
I…

24:46.920 --> 24:48.400
If I reveal it,

24:48.400 --> 24:49.704
I'll definitely get beaten.

24:50.880 --> 24:53.240
Understood, the moral code of martial artists.

24:53.839 --> 24:55.319
Keeping promises is rule number one.

24:55.319 --> 24:56.680
Then you must absolutely not say it.

24:56.680 --> 24:57.759
- We won't listen.
- Won't listen.

24:57.759 --> 25:00.039
It's not… it's not that serious.

25:00.039 --> 25:01.320
It's just…

25:02.319 --> 25:03.319
My mother

25:04.000 --> 25:05.519
suffers from ill fortune.

25:05.519 --> 25:07.200
Her stomach is full and her knees are swollen.

25:07.200 --> 25:08.880
She passes gas every day.

25:08.880 --> 25:10.279
I am truly bothered by it.

25:10.839 --> 25:11.880
Chun,

25:11.880 --> 25:13.680
if you can help her,

25:13.680 --> 25:14.799
whether you want

25:14.799 --> 25:16.240
some exquisite ginseng

25:16.240 --> 25:17.880
or some handsome man,

25:17.880 --> 25:19.000
I will bring them all to you.

25:19.640 --> 25:21.480
Of course, I would want the ginseng.

25:21.480 --> 25:22.519
Handsome man,

25:22.519 --> 25:23.920
what would I want that for?

25:25.640 --> 25:27.359
Don't tell my mother.

25:27.359 --> 25:28.599
If she finds out,

25:28.599 --> 25:29.680
she'll definitely punish me again.

25:29.680 --> 25:30.920
She seems to be

25:30.920 --> 25:32.039
usually good-natured,

25:32.039 --> 25:33.279
but when she gets fierce…

26:23.240 --> 26:24.839
What are you doing here?

26:24.839 --> 26:25.960
It's the child's memorial day.

26:25.960 --> 26:27.640
I knew you would come.

26:27.640 --> 26:29.799
You're sad, but how could I be heartless?

26:29.799 --> 26:31.279
Every time I think of our child,

26:31.279 --> 26:32.680
I am still in deep sorrow.

26:35.000 --> 26:36.240
Drop your insincere act.

26:36.920 --> 26:39.200
In all these years, when have you
ever burned paper for him?

26:40.799 --> 26:42.359
Before, I was unwilling to face it.

26:42.359 --> 26:43.880
Now, I have come to my senses.

26:44.599 --> 26:45.960
It was my negligence.

26:45.960 --> 26:47.319
I didn't take care of your health

26:47.319 --> 26:48.559
and let you overwork yourself

26:48.559 --> 26:50.039
which made us lose the child.

26:50.039 --> 26:51.039
Hit me.

26:51.559 --> 26:54.160
Just hit me. Hit me now.

26:56.640 --> 26:58.039
I hate myself even more.

26:58.880 --> 27:00.119
I had a moment of folly

27:00.720 --> 27:02.200
and let you leave.

27:07.400 --> 27:08.920
Those sisters of yours

27:08.920 --> 27:10.559
have never been married

27:10.559 --> 27:11.960
or become mothers.

27:11.960 --> 27:13.319
They have no idea of your suffering.

27:13.960 --> 27:15.359
After your miscarriage,

27:15.359 --> 27:16.839
you became weak and susceptible to cold.

27:16.839 --> 27:17.920
I brought this hand warmer

27:17.920 --> 27:19.240
to keep you warm.

27:25.880 --> 27:27.240
The child is gone.

27:29.640 --> 27:32.119
Our marital fate has ended.

27:33.880 --> 27:35.319
What's the point

27:36.200 --> 27:37.920
of doing all this?

27:41.960 --> 27:43.079
All things in the past

27:44.039 --> 27:45.359
are all my fault.

27:47.119 --> 27:48.359
I only beg the heavens

27:49.039 --> 27:51.720
to grant me another chance.

27:52.319 --> 27:55.000
I will surely treasure you, love you,

27:55.720 --> 27:57.119
and protect our home.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.392
Wuniang,

28:01.119 --> 28:02.559
in this world, apart from me,

28:03.400 --> 28:06.319
who else would think of you
and miss you like this?

28:09.920 --> 28:11.039
I can't leave you.

28:12.160 --> 28:14.160
I know you must feel the same.

28:16.200 --> 28:17.359
Let's be good.

28:18.839 --> 28:22.079
We'll have children again in the future.

28:25.960 --> 28:28.440
Wuniang. Wuniang.

28:31.160 --> 28:32.296
Wuniang.

28:38.640 --> 28:39.848
Wuniang.

28:50.160 --> 28:51.480
Mr. Jiang, I allowed you

28:51.480 --> 28:53.759
to drink with me in the pavilion,

28:53.759 --> 28:54.880
but I didn't allow you

28:54.880 --> 28:56.000
to steal my chicken.

28:57.640 --> 28:58.759
Ordinary merchants

28:58.759 --> 29:00.720
would give gifts to their major clients.

29:00.720 --> 29:02.200
I am your biggest creditor,

29:02.759 --> 29:04.319
yet you won't even offer a bite to eat.

29:04.319 --> 29:05.480
You're so stingy.

29:05.480 --> 29:07.079
How can you do good business?

29:07.079 --> 29:08.599
Who says there's no food?

29:08.599 --> 29:10.160
All of this is for you.

29:10.160 --> 29:11.400
But not that chicken.

29:11.400 --> 29:12.440
It's for someone else.

29:14.119 --> 29:15.336
Who?

29:15.920 --> 29:17.920
Do you have your eye on some young man?

29:17.920 --> 29:19.359
Let me take a look for you.

29:19.359 --> 29:21.920
When have you ever seen me
take an interest in a young man?

29:22.640 --> 29:25.039
Shengyi is coming back tonight.

29:25.039 --> 29:27.119
Surely she is exhausted from the journey.

29:27.119 --> 29:28.599
I prepared this for her

29:28.599 --> 29:29.799
to help her recuperate.

29:31.720 --> 29:33.119
Shengyi

29:33.119 --> 29:34.720
never shies away from hard work.

29:34.720 --> 29:36.839
No matter how tough or tiring,
she never complains.

29:37.680 --> 29:40.519
I know she tends to be sensitive to the cold.

29:40.519 --> 29:42.839
I guess it's the lingering ailment
from her time at Wang Qing's place.

29:43.559 --> 29:44.640
She won't let Chun

29:44.640 --> 29:45.720
to take her pulse.

29:46.400 --> 29:47.519
So

29:47.519 --> 29:48.960
I can only pay

29:48.960 --> 29:50.200
more attention to her diet.

29:52.880 --> 29:54.799
I lived in the south of the Yangtze
for several years when I was a child.

29:55.400 --> 29:58.559
Locals would wrap a chicken
in lotus leaves and roast it.

29:58.559 --> 29:59.640
In doing so,

29:59.640 --> 30:00.680
the roasted chicken

30:00.680 --> 30:01.960
will have a natural fragrance of herbs.

30:02.759 --> 30:04.960
I heard that Doctor Chun was making medicine

30:04.960 --> 30:06.799
and left a few lotus leaves in your room.

30:06.799 --> 30:08.119
Now is a good time to try.

30:09.039 --> 30:10.536
That's right.

30:21.480 --> 30:23.079
Don't worry.

30:23.079 --> 30:25.240
That's fire. Would I dare to touch it?

30:29.480 --> 30:30.480
That's true.

30:35.119 --> 30:36.319
Don't touch my chicken.

30:53.759 --> 30:55.144
My chicken!

30:56.720 --> 30:57.880
Jiang Changyang!

31:01.880 --> 31:03.440
My lord, I…

31:03.440 --> 31:05.079
have followed your instructions

31:05.079 --> 31:06.920
and delivered the Dendrobium to the backyard.

31:09.279 --> 31:11.400
But Lady He is still angry.

31:11.400 --> 31:13.720
She even called you a chicken thief.

31:15.960 --> 31:17.599
That Dendrobium was a reward from His Majesty,

31:17.599 --> 31:18.759
rare and precious.

31:19.440 --> 31:21.200
Her family runs a pharmacy,

31:21.200 --> 31:22.240
so she must know its worth.

31:22.759 --> 31:24.240
It is far more nourishing than roasted chicken.

31:24.799 --> 31:26.400
Why should she scold me then?

31:26.400 --> 31:27.880
Lady He said

31:27.880 --> 31:29.960
'Taking without asking deserves a scolding.'

31:31.799 --> 31:32.839
My lord,

31:32.839 --> 31:34.640
you clearly know there's nothing
special about this chicken,

31:34.640 --> 31:36.200
so why steal it?

31:36.200 --> 31:37.759
What do you know?

31:37.759 --> 31:39.519
What I'm seeking is delight.

32:17.440 --> 32:18.728
My lord.

32:27.559 --> 32:31.095
[Evidence of Guilt]

32:33.440 --> 32:34.880
After all this time,

32:34.880 --> 32:36.839
this is all you've confessed?

32:36.839 --> 32:38.400
And it's 30% true and 70% fake.

32:39.880 --> 32:41.400
It's time to serve some substantial dishes.

32:56.720 --> 32:58.640
Cui Mao.

32:58.640 --> 33:00.480
How do you like

33:00.480 --> 33:01.800
this wine I'm serving you?

33:03.799 --> 33:05.079
Jiang Changyang

33:06.680 --> 33:09.079
So you've been acting all along.

33:11.279 --> 33:12.880
You brought me here.

33:13.759 --> 33:16.079
Aren't you afraid of someone finding out?

33:16.960 --> 33:18.319
Clearly, you knocked out the official

33:18.319 --> 33:19.960
and ran away.

33:19.960 --> 33:21.039
What does that have to do with me?

33:21.880 --> 33:23.319
The official escorting you

33:23.319 --> 33:24.799
has reported your death
from illness on the journey

33:24.799 --> 33:26.799
to avoid punishment for dereliction of duty.

33:26.799 --> 33:29.880
Now, no one knows you are still alive.

33:32.119 --> 33:33.576
I have a habit

33:34.519 --> 33:35.839
of preparing a good jar of wine

33:35.839 --> 33:37.559
for those who come in.

33:38.319 --> 33:39.440
If one is innocent,

33:39.440 --> 33:41.599
I give it to him to drink when he leaves.

33:42.279 --> 33:43.319
If one is guilty,

33:44.480 --> 33:45.519
I will take this wine

33:46.200 --> 33:47.480
and pour it on his grave.

33:49.559 --> 33:51.119
You, on the other hand,

33:51.119 --> 33:52.160
are slow to confess.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.079
The wine has aged.

33:54.920 --> 33:56.160
I have said

33:57.359 --> 33:58.640
what should be said.

33:59.319 --> 34:01.000
Trading official posts

34:01.000 --> 34:02.839
was all my doing.

34:03.359 --> 34:04.680
Apart from that,

34:05.720 --> 34:08.319
I have not committed any other crime.

34:09.679 --> 34:11.560
Is that so?

34:22.679 --> 34:24.800
The merchant Li from Huameng County

34:24.800 --> 34:26.920
had his goods robbed on March 30th.

34:27.559 --> 34:28.719
His family heirloom jade pendant

34:28.719 --> 34:31.119
soon appeared on Cui Mao.

34:31.119 --> 34:32.280
Li went to report to the officials,

34:32.800 --> 34:35.440
and that very night, his whole family
was silenced by bandits.

34:36.719 --> 34:38.320
At the end of last autumn, the Cui Mansion

34:38.320 --> 34:40.400
encroached upon 200 mu
of the Yang family's good farmland.

34:42.119 --> 34:43.960
I forgot to tell you.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.480
No one has entered this dark chamber

34:45.480 --> 34:47.039
and come out innocent.

34:48.000 --> 34:49.159
For each day you don't confess,

34:49.719 --> 34:51.360
I'll find another day's
worth of evidence against you.

34:52.360 --> 34:54.079
Six Types of Embezzlement and encroaching lands

34:54.079 --> 34:55.400
are all serious crimes.

34:56.639 --> 34:58.239
You won't be able to live.

34:58.239 --> 34:59.400
But you can choose

34:59.400 --> 35:01.000
to suffer less torment before dying.

35:06.079 --> 35:07.360
Still not talking?

35:09.360 --> 35:10.719
Alright.

35:10.719 --> 35:11.800
I'll have a late-night snack first

36:35.440 --> 36:38.199
What have you done to my son?

36:41.480 --> 36:43.000
Are you desperate?

36:44.079 --> 36:45.239
If you confess,

36:45.239 --> 36:47.119
you're afraid that those behind you
will massacre your entire family.

36:48.000 --> 36:49.679
If you don't confess,

36:49.679 --> 36:51.679
you're afraid that I'll kill your eldest son.

36:52.760 --> 36:54.079
I will bear

36:55.280 --> 36:57.440
all the crimes.

36:57.440 --> 36:59.079
I'm begging you.

36:59.079 --> 37:01.199
Please don't harm them.

37:03.400 --> 37:04.800
The crimes you have committed

37:05.559 --> 37:07.159
are unknown to your wife and son.

37:08.320 --> 37:09.480
Indeed, they don't deserve

37:09.480 --> 37:10.760
to die because of you.

37:17.079 --> 37:18.840
If I admit guilt and sign,

37:20.480 --> 37:21.760
once this testimony

37:21.760 --> 37:22.840
is submitted,

37:24.599 --> 37:27.679
Prince Ning will find out
that I'm still alive. By that time, I…

37:27.679 --> 37:29.000
By that time,

37:29.000 --> 37:30.639
I will have already sent them out of Chang'an,

37:30.639 --> 37:31.679
and no one will be able to find them.

37:33.840 --> 37:34.960
But as I send them away,

37:35.599 --> 37:37.519
I will not take the money you've embezzled.

37:38.320 --> 37:39.320
In the future,

37:39.320 --> 37:40.679
they will live in poverty,

37:41.519 --> 37:43.039
but they will also live peacefully and quietly.

37:50.719 --> 37:51.840
At the mourning hall,

37:52.920 --> 37:54.519
your son wept incessantly.

37:56.079 --> 37:57.480
I told him

37:57.480 --> 37:58.880
that I have immense magical powers,

37:59.880 --> 38:01.840
capable of sending this pellet
drum to the underworld

38:02.519 --> 38:04.039
and delivering it to his father.

38:04.760 --> 38:06.639
He believed me

38:06.639 --> 38:08.159
and asked me to bring you a message.

38:10.559 --> 38:12.119
He said

38:12.119 --> 38:13.760
even though he couldn't
ever see his father again,

38:15.360 --> 38:17.280
he would always remember his father.

38:19.119 --> 38:20.840
He hoped that in the next life,

38:20.840 --> 38:21.840
his father would be a good official

38:22.679 --> 38:24.480
so that they could continue
the father-son bond.

39:05.119 --> 39:06.664
Shengyi.

39:07.639 --> 39:08.800
Shengyi, are you asleep?

39:18.079 --> 39:19.320
Shengyi.

39:19.320 --> 39:21.400
I saw you went straight back
to your room once you returned.

39:21.400 --> 39:22.760
You looked very weary.

39:23.679 --> 39:24.880
Did something happen

39:24.880 --> 39:26.000
at home?

39:26.559 --> 39:27.960
Would you like to talk to me about it?

39:29.119 --> 39:31.280
Everything at home is still the same.

39:32.199 --> 39:33.440
There is nothing to say.

39:34.840 --> 39:37.039
Mudan, I am a bit tired.

39:37.639 --> 39:38.840
I want to rest early.

39:40.039 --> 39:41.679
Drink this tonic soup while it's hot.

39:42.440 --> 39:44.320
Your body will feel better after drinking it.

39:45.519 --> 39:47.599
Whenever you want to talk to me,

39:47.599 --> 39:48.760
call me anytime.

39:48.760 --> 39:49.768
Here.

39:51.079 --> 39:53.159
Did you specifically make it for me?

39:53.920 --> 39:55.199
Of course.

39:55.199 --> 39:57.000
I originally roasted a chicken for you,

39:57.000 --> 39:58.880
but it was stolen by the neighbor.

39:59.519 --> 40:00.760
Fortunately, he was sensible enough

40:00.760 --> 40:02.159
to send over fine Dendrobium.

40:03.320 --> 40:04.639
I won't say more, come on.

40:04.639 --> 40:06.312
Hurry and drink it while it's hot.

40:10.119 --> 40:11.960
Rest early, and don't think too much.

40:26.440 --> 40:28.239
My lord, the evidence is ready.

40:28.239 --> 40:30.400
When shall we set off?

40:30.400 --> 40:31.760
Naturally, the sooner the better.

40:33.079 --> 40:34.239
But we need an excuse

40:35.000 --> 40:36.000
to go to Luoyang.

40:38.199 --> 40:40.159
His Majesty has a heavy heart

40:40.719 --> 40:42.159
because his teacher has passed away.

40:42.679 --> 40:44.320
The Floral Envoy wishes to find fine items

40:44.320 --> 40:46.079
to ease His Majesty's mind. How about it?

40:48.440 --> 40:49.800
Go call for the lunch meal.

40:49.800 --> 40:51.599
Pack up after eating.

40:51.599 --> 40:52.808
Yes.

40:55.440 --> 40:57.096
Mr. Jiang.

41:04.079 --> 41:05.384
Lady He.

41:11.840 --> 41:13.400
Greetings.

41:13.400 --> 41:14.880
Weren't you scolding me last night?

41:15.679 --> 41:17.000
Did you take the wrong medicine today?

41:17.599 --> 41:18.880
No, I took the right medicine.

41:19.440 --> 41:21.920
Thank you for the Dendrobium
you sent yesterday, Mr. Jiang.

41:21.920 --> 41:23.880
After eating it, Shengyi felt much better.

41:23.880 --> 41:26.320
So here I am, bringing a thank-you gift.

41:27.719 --> 41:28.960
Such an expensive tonic was

41:29.519 --> 41:30.800
only exchanged for these few shabby cakes.

41:35.039 --> 41:37.519
Enjoy your meal, Mr. Jiang. I will leave now.

41:38.280 --> 41:39.688
Wait.

42:00.382 --> 42:06.656
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:08.510 --> 42:15.194
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:15.870 --> 42:23.068
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:24.062 --> 42:32.414
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:32.414 --> 42:39.957
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:40.611 --> 42:48.798
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:48.798 --> 42:56.609
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:57.214 --> 43:04.506
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:25.182 --> 43:32.065
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:33.366 --> 43:40.060
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:40.817 --> 43:48.119
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:48.803 --> 43:57.112
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

43:57.112 --> 44:04.543
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:05.374 --> 44:13.630
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:13.630 --> 44:21.054
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:22.058 --> 44:29.508
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
